---
// WhatsappWhy.astro
---
<section class="py-24 bg-[#25D366]">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center text-slate-900">
    <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-black leading-tight mb-8">
      Because you're already here all day.
    </h2>
    <p class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-semibold leading-relaxed opacity-90 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      No new app to download. No password to reset. No team to train. If you can send a WhatsApp message, you can read your business. That's the whole idea.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
